<!-- PUSH-02: the host's status-bar icon for Pulsate notifications. The SDK
     builds every notification with R.drawable.status_icon
     (PulsateNotification.kt:111), so a host drawable of the same name wins
     at resource merge time and replaces the SDK's default. Status icons are
     white on transparent; the system tints them. -->
